        <fig id="article-128653.image.f2" position="float" orientation="portrait">
          <caption>
            <p>Monophasic Waveform. Doppler ultrasound of the right posterior tibial artery demonstrating a classic monophasic waveform. Monophasic waveforms in peripheral arteries are abnormal and suggest hemodynamically significant proximal disease. The red arrow highlights spectral broadening. Contributed by B Covello, MD</p>
          </caption>
          <graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="monophasic" position="float" orientation="portrait"/>
